WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.145
On your phone, open Files. The Vawra file is in Downloads.

2
00:00:04.145 --> 00:00:08.745
Open the file.

3
00:00:08.745 --> 00:00:20.882
Android asks before installing. Tap Install.

4
00:00:20.882 --> 00:00:29.788
Installed. Tap Open.

5
00:00:29.788 --> 00:00:43.164
Confirm you are 18 or older and agree to the guidelines.

6
00:00:43.164 --> 00:00:52.940
Create your profile: your name,

7
00:00:52.940 --> 00:01:02.502
your age,

8
00:01:02.502 --> 00:01:18.346
how you identify and who you would like to meet,

9
00:01:18.346 --> 00:01:26.141
what you are looking for,

10
00:01:26.141 --> 00:01:40.297
and a few interests.

11
00:01:40.297 --> 00:01:49.303
Habits and an intro can wait.

12
00:01:49.303 --> 00:01:51.200
Choose your privacy settings, then tap Start discovering.
